__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.venv/
dist/
build/
# mkdocs build output (`poetry run mkdocs build`)
site/
*.egg-info/
.pytest_cache/
.ruff_cache/
.coverage
.coverage.*
coverage.xml
htmlcov/
.DS_Store
uv.lock

# A vault's own graph. A real vault keeps its .vaultkg/ beside its notes; one
# built under this repo is a test or demo run and is never tracked.
.vaultkg/

# Render output: quilts from `vaultkg quilt`, pages from `vaultkg viz`.
renders/
*_links.html

# === KG generated artifacts (normalized across the fleet) ===
# Databases, vector indexes and model caches are transient and
# reproducible. snapshots/ is TRACKED and must never be ignored --
# never use a bare `**/.<ns>/` pattern here, it swallows snapshots too.

**/.pycodekg/*.sqlite
**/.pycodekg/*.sqlite-shm
**/.pycodekg/*.sqlite-wal
**/.pycodekg/*.db
**/.pycodekg/models

**/.dockg/*.sqlite
**/.dockg/*.sqlite-shm
**/.dockg/*.sqlite-wal
**/.dockg/*.db
**/.dockg/models
**/.dockg/embeddings.json

# AgentKG local store -- nothing under it is ever tracked
**/.agentkg/

# Agent scratch dirs (Claude Code / Codex)
.agents/
.codex/

# MCP server config -- machine-specific, contains absolute paths
.mcp.json.sav
# === end KG generated artifacts ===
